WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
A 9–12 shift fits six 30-minute visits
when there’s no cleanup gap.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Keep the same shift. Set the buffer to
10 minutes between visits.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:12.250
Calculate again. Four visits fit, and
the last one ends at 11:30.

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:18.000
Thirty minutes remain. A fifth visit
would need 40: 10 to clean, 30 to work.
